  "notes": "Implemented plain-SYCL helper-library runtime quantization in ggml/src/ggml-sycl/quantize.{hpp,cpp}. Covered F32 -> Q8_0 and F32 -> Q8_1 row helpers matching CUDA quantize.cu semantics used by quantized matmul helpers. MMQ scatter, MXFP4, and NVFP4 helper paths remain residual by design. Selftest passes bit-exact against ggml/src/ggml-quants.c for Q8_0 and against a direct CUDA-semantics Q8_1 reference. No current SYCL consumer is wired to this helper yet; it is ready for later mmq/mmvq/getrows integration.",
